  title: B O N   V O Y A G E
  button: BON VOYAGE
  riddle: 'Wings, but never a feather;

    a roar, but never a beast.

    I lift
    you over the weather

    and set you down somewhere east.'
  hint: A propeller plane flying to the right.
  complete: 'CLEARED FOR TAKE-OFF

    Window seat, please.'
